# TestCity recipe: Layers (Water, Grass, Pollution, Desirability),
# Units RCI (Home / Work / Shop / Restaurant), Agents as commuters and freight,
# ZoneRules for growth. Pair with sandbox.ogc.
#
# Periods are written as game time. A bare number would count simulation ticks,
# twenty of which make one game minute, which says nothing to a reader.

resources
	resource Water
	resource Grass
	resource People
	resource Money
	resource Goods
	resource Power
	resource Pollution
	resource Trash
	resource Happiness
end

paths
	path Road color 0xAAAAAA
end

segments
	segment Dirt color 0xAAAAAA speed 30 capacity 20 beta 4
end

agents
	agent People color 0xFFFF00 speed 10
	agent Worker color 0xFFFFFF speed 10
	agent Shopper color 0xFFAA00 speed 12
	agent Diner color 0xFF6644 speed 12
	agent Truck color 0x8888FF speed 8
end

rules
	layerRule CreateGrass
		rate 20 minutes
		layer Water remove 10 randomTilesPercent 90
		layer Grass add 1
	end

	# Pollution fades faster than it spreads on its own: what fouls a
	# neighbourhood is the factories, not the passing of time.
	layerRule SpreadPollution
		rate 30 minutes
		layer Pollution add 1
	end

	layerRule CleanPollution
		rate 15 minutes
		layer Pollution remove 1
	end

	# Desirability is the slow variable of the city. It used to move every ten
	# ticks, half a game minute, so a district was built and abandoned within
	# the hour. It now takes days to turn a good address into a bad one.
	layerRule DropDesirability
		rate 2 hours
		layer Pollution greater 20
		layer Desirability remove 2
	end

	layerRule RaiseDesirability
		rate 2 hours
		layer Pollution less 5
		layer Desirability add 1
	end

	# What shares a household between the factories and the shops is the period
	# of the rules and the number of residents, not a condition on the house:
	# one leaves for work every three quarters of an hour here, against one
	# every three hours in ShopForGoods. Sending one out every twenty minutes
	# emptied the houses long before the shops opened, and every agent the city
	# ever made was a worker. A period runs on the clock of its own building,
	# from a random phase, so a house grown at noon starts its commute within
	# the hour instead of waiting for the next morning.
	buildingRule SendPeopleToWork
		rate 45 minutes
		hour between 8 18
		local People greater 0
		local People remove 1
		agent Worker to Work add [ People 1 ]
	end

	buildingRule SendPeopleToHome
		rate 20 minutes
		hour between 18 22
		local People remove 1
		agent People to Home add [ People 1 ]
	end

	buildingRule ProduceGoods
		rate 30 minutes
		hour between 8 18
		local People greater 0
		local Goods add 1
		layer Pollution add 1
		global Money add 1
	end

	# The goods leave the factory on their own wheels. Without this the shops
	# never had anything to sell, and the workers looked like they were carrying
	# the stock home in the evening.
	buildingRule ShipGoods
		rate 45 minutes
		local Goods remove 1
		agent Truck to Shop add [ Goods 1 ]
	end

	# The restaurants are supplied by name. They used to answer to Shop as well,
	# which is how a truck bound for a shop, and a resident going shopping,
	# ended their trip at the nearest canteen instead.
	buildingRule ShipFood
		rate 2 hours
		local Goods remove 1
		agent Truck to Restaurant add [ Goods 1 ]
	end

	buildingRule GoEating
		rate 30 minutes
		hour between 12 14
		local People greater 0
		local People remove 1
		agent Diner to Restaurant add [ People 1 ]
	end

	buildingRule UsePeopleToWater
		rate 1 hour
		local People greater 1
		layer Water add 30
	end

	buildingRule ShopForGoods
		rate 3 hours
		hour between 10 20
		local People greater 0
		global Money greater 0
		local People remove 1
		agent Shopper to Shop add [ People 1 ]
	end

	# A shop sells to the customers standing in it. Without the condition it
	# turned its stock into money on its own, and the shoppers were decoration.
	buildingRule SellGoods
		rate 20 minutes
		local People greater 0
		local Goods remove 1
		global Money add 2
		local Happiness add 1
	end

	buildingRule ServeLunch
		rate 15 minutes
		local People greater 0
		local Goods remove 1
		local Happiness add 1
	end

	buildingRule SendDinersBack
		rate 20 minutes
		hour between 13 15
		local People greater 0
		local People remove 1
		agent Worker to Work add [ People 1 ]
	end

	buildingRule ReceiveShopper
		rate 30 minutes
		local People greater 0
		local People remove 1
		agent People to Home add [ People 1 ]
	end

	buildingRule CollectTrash
		rate 1 hour
		layer Trash remove 2
	end

	zoneRule GrowHomes
		rate 4 hours
		count Home less 10
		spawn Home at nearestSegment
	end

	zoneRule GrowShops
		rate 6 hours
		count Shop less 3
		spawn Shop at nearestSegment
	end

	zoneRule GrowRestaurants
		rate 12 hours
		count Restaurant less 2
		spawn Restaurant at nearestSegment
	end

	zoneRule GrowWorks
		rate 8 hours
		count Work less 3
		spawn Work at nearestSegment
	end

	zoneRule AbandonHomes
		rate 1 day
		layer Desirability less 2
		count Home greater 2
		destroy Home
	end
end

buildings
	building Home color 0xFF00FF layerRadius 1 rules [ SendPeopleToWork ShopForGoods ] targets [ Home ] caps [ People 8 Happiness 10 ] resources [ People 8 ]
	building Work color 0x00AAFF layerRadius 3 rules [ SendPeopleToHome ProduceGoods ShipGoods ShipFood GoEating UsePeopleToWater ] targets [ Work ] caps [ People 12 Goods 20 ] resources [ ]
	building Shop color 0xFFAA00 layerRadius 2 rules [ SellGoods ReceiveShopper CollectTrash ] targets [ Shop ] caps [ People 6 Goods 30 Happiness 20 ] resources [ ]
	building Restaurant color 0xFF6644 layerRadius 1 rules [ ServeLunch SendDinersBack ] targets [ Restaurant ] caps [ People 8 Goods 20 Happiness 20 ] resources [ ]
end

layers
	layer Water color 0x0000FF capacity 100 rules [  ]
	layer Grass color 0x00FF00 capacity 10 rules [ CreateGrass ]
	layer Pollution color 0x555555 capacity 80 rules [ SpreadPollution CleanPollution ]
	layer Desirability color 0x88FF88 capacity 50 rules [ DropDesirability RaiseDesirability ]
	layer Trash color 0x886644 capacity 40 rules [  ]
	layer Power color 0xFFFF66 capacity 100 rules [  ]
end

zones
	zone Residential color 0x44AA44 rules [ GrowHomes AbandonHomes ]
	zone Commercial color 0xDDAA44 rules [ GrowShops GrowRestaurants ]
	zone Industrial color 0xAA6644 rules [ GrowWorks ]
end
